        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 155.86,
          "end": 160.52,
          "en": "with the main courseGoals state with help of this Button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 160.52,
          "end": 161.89,
          "en": "But now the problem, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 161.89,
          "end": 163.7,
          "en": "is that the courseGoals state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 163.7,
          "end": 165.8,
          "en": "is managed in the App component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 165.8,
          "end": 169.11,
          "en": "whereas, the inputs are in a different component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 169.11,
          "end": 171.92000000000002,
          "en": "But that's a common problem in react apps",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 171.92000000000002,
          "end": 174.4,
          "en": "and not specific to react-native,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 174.4,
          "end": 177.84,
          "en": "and we can solve it as we solve it in all react apps.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 177.84,
          "end": 181.09,
          "en": "We can also talk to the parent component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 181.09,
          "end": 185.173,
          "en": "by passing event handler functions via props.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 186.12,
          "end": 189.08,
          "en": "So here, for example, we can accept props on GoalInput",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 190.25,
          "end": 195.25,
          "en": "and expect a special prop which could be named, onAddGoal,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 196,
          "end": 199.18,
          "en": "to be provided by the parent component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 199.18,
          "end": 201.74,
          "en": "which actually holds a function as a value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 201.74,
          "end": 203.893,
          "en": "that will be executed upon a press.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 204.99,
          "end": 206.89,
          "en": "So now in the App component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 206.89,
          "end": 210.62,
          "en": "we can use the GoalInput component We just added,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 210.62,
          "end": 215.433,
          "en": "we can import GoalInput from ./components/GoalInput.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 218.68,
          "end": 221.88,
          "en": "And we can use this component here in that place,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 221.88,
          "end": 225.67000000000002,
          "en": "where we had all the input related markup before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 225.67000000000002,
          "end": 229.04,
          "en": "And set this onAddGoal prop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 229.04,
          "end": 233.7,
          "en": "which we expect to get here in our GoalInput component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 233.7,
          "end": 236.59,
          "en": "And now, since we set this prop's value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 236.59,
          "end": 239.21,
          "en": "as a value for the onPress prop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 239.21,
          "end": 242.8,
          "en": "and that prop wants a function to be executed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 242.8,
          "end": 247.013,
          "en": "we should pass a function to onAddGoal in the App component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 248.249,
          "end": 252.34,
          "en": "And we still pass our addGoalHandler here, just like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 253.4,
          "end": 255.19,
          "en": "Now what does change though",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 255.19,
          "end": 256.93,
          "en": "is how we handle the user input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 256.93,
          "end": 258.58299999999997,
          "en": "How we fetch the user input?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 259.64,
          "end": 262.49,
          "en": "Because this GoalInputHandler and the state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 262.49,
          "end": 265.81,
          "en": "that manages the entered input is in the wrong place now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 265.81,
          "end": 268.45,
          "en": "We don't do this in the App component anymore.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 268.45,
          "end": 272.103,
          "en": "Because the TextInput element is in the GoalInput component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 273.27,
          "end": 275.83,
          "en": "What we should do therefore is grab that state,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 275.83,
          "end": 277.733,
          "en": "and cut it from the App component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 279.03,
          "end": 283.883,
          "en": "and move it into the GoalInput component, like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 285.34000000000003,
          "end": 288.87,
          "en": "For this, of course, we must make sure that we import",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 288.87,
          "end": 293.84000000000003,
          "en": "useState from react, in this GoalInput component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 293.84000000000003,
          "end": 295.793,
          "en": "So that we can use this function here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 297.14,
          "end": 298.4,
          "en": "Now we got this state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 298.4,
          "end": 301.07,
          "en": "We also need this GoalInputHandler function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 301.07,
          "end": 302.723,
          "en": "which updates the state though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 303.69,
          "end": 307.27,
          "en": "So that in the App component, only the courseGoals state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 307.27,
          "end": 309.87,
          "en": "and the addGoalHandler function is left.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 309.87,
          "end": 312.52,
          "en": "We will treat this function as second as well though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 313.48,
          "end": 315.55,
          "en": "In GoalInput.js, we can now paste in",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 315.55,
          "end": 317.753,
          "en": "that GoalInputHandler function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 318.72,
          "end": 319.62,
          "en": "And therefore this is now,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 319.62,
          "end": 321.97,
          "en": "again, connected to onChangeText,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 321.97,
          "end": 324.01,
          "en": "where we point at this function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 324.01,
          "end": 328.03,
          "en": "So this enteredGoalText is still being handled here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 328.03,
          "end": 331.53,
          "en": "Now, the only problem is that this enteredGoalText",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 331.53,
          "end": 334,
          "en": "is eventually needed in the App component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 334,
          "end": 335.983,
          "en": "when we add a new goal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 337.04,
          "end": 339.04,
          "en": "and therefore we also need to make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 339.04,
          "end": 342.793,
          "en": "that this data arrives here in addGoalHandler.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 343.93,
          "end": 347.16700000000003,
          "en": "The easiest way of ensuring this would be",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 347.16700000000003,
          "end": 351.493,
          "en": "to expect the enteredGoalText as a parameter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 352.48,
          "end": 355.06,
          "en": "So that whenever addGoalHandler is called,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 355.06,
          "end": 358.55,
          "en": "we get this text and we can use it in here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 358.55,
          "end": 360.72,
          "en": "Now, this function is fine.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 360.72,
          "end": 363.54,
          "en": "But right now this text wouldn't be provided.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 363.54,
          "end": 367.01,
          "en": "addGoalHandler is passed as a value",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 367.01,
          "end": 368.88,
          "en": "to onAddGoal on the GoalInput,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 370.91,
          "end": 374.13,
          "en": "and onAddGoal is forwarded to onPress,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 374.13,
          "end": 377.76,
          "en": "and onPress which ultimately calls this function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 377.76,
          "end": 381.55,
          "en": "does not provide this enteredGoalText.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 381.55,
          "end": 383.46,
          "en": "To make sure that it does,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 383.46,
          "end": 387.14,
          "en": "we have to change something in our code here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 387.14,
          "end": 390.06,
          "en": "For example, we can add another function here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 390.06,
          "end": 393.17,
          "en": "in our GoalInput component file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 393.17,
          "end": 397.13,
          "en": "and name this function addGoalHandler, again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 397.13,
          "end": 400.67,
          "en": "So now we have this function or a function with this name",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 400.67,
          "end": 403.39,
          "en": "in both GoalInput and App, but that's no problem",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 403.39,
          "end": 405.15999999999997,
          "en": "because we're in different components here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 405.15999999999997,
          "end": 407.61,
          "en": "Hence, we have no name clash.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 407.61,
          "end": 409.22,
          "en": "Now in this function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 409.22,
          "end": 413.17,
          "en": "I actually want to execute props onAddGoal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 413.17,
          "end": 415.73,
          "en": "So I want to call this onAddGoal function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 415.73,
          "end": 417.8,
          "en": "which we receive here manually",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 418.82,
          "end": 420.65,
          "en": "And then, onPress is connected",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 420.65,
          "end": 423.453,
          "en": "to this addGoalHandler function which I just added.",
          "zh": ""
        },
